OL,3,GNEWSABonnybridge couple lose 'angel's
OL,4,Ashare' fungus claim against Diageo
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Lord Young concluded that the
OL,7,Fdiscoloration, which developed over
OL,8,Ftime, did not amount to "a material
OL,9,Floss or inconvenience" or was
OL,10,F"destructive of the ordinary comfort of
OL,11,Flife".
